---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="About me" active="about">
  <section class="intro" aria-labelledby="intro-title">
    <div class="intro-copy">
      <h1 id="intro-title">hello, i’m<br /><em>Jamily Lee!</em></h1>
    </div>
    <div class="matcha"><img src={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}strawberry-matcha.png`} alt="Watercolor illustration of a strawberry matcha drink" /></div>
  </section>
  <section class="about-section" aria-label="About Jamily">
    <div class="prose">
      <p>I was born in Taiwan and began playing violin at seven. I’m now pursuing dual degrees in Violin Performance and Music Education at UCLA, where I study with Varty Manouelian.</p>
      <p>I played with the San Francisco Symphony Youth Orchestra from 2021 to 2024. At the Chautauqua Institution School of Music, I performed Mahler with members of the Chautauqua Symphony Orchestra and Buffalo Philharmonic. In 2023, I was concertmaster for the children’s concert at the Round Top Festival Institute.</p>
      <p>I’ve also performed with Jacob Collier at Davies Symphony Hall and Zade Dirani at UCLA’s Royce Hall. I care just as much about teaching: I was a Teaching Fellow at Elemental Music in 2025–26, and I’ve taught private violin and piano lessons and coached string sectionals since 2020. I love helping young musicians grow their skills and enjoy making music.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
